    sdo:description "The Indigenous Studies Unit undertakes research aiming to improve outcomes in Indigenous health and wellbeing, particularly in relation to alcohol misuse and family violence, Indigenous data governance, digital archives, cultural heritage, technology and resource management. We make regular contributions to Parliamentary reviews and Inquiries, cross-platform media, and policy development." ;
    sdo:name "Indigenous Studies Unit of the University of Melbourne" ;
    sdo:url "https://mspgh.unimelb.edu.au/centres-institutes/onemda/research-group/indigenous-studies-unit"^^xsd:anyURI ;
.

